      "unit_type": "prose",
      "text": "BORN FROM CENTURIES OF TAVERN REVELRY AND ERRANT MAGIC, THE ALE ELEMENTAL LURCHES THROUGH THE WORLD AS A SLOSHING, FOAM-BODIED PRANKSTER. KEGS AND RIVERBANKS QUIVER AT ITS PASSING, AND FEW CAN WITHSTAND THE CHAOS OF ITS FROTHY ERUPTIONS AND INTOXICATING AURA. THOUGH NOT THE MIGHTIEST OF ELEMENTALS, IT LEAVES A TRAIL OF LAUGHTER, CONFUSION, SUDS, AND BRUISED EGOS. MANY AN ADVENTURER HAS SLIPPED, STAGGERED, OR FOUND THEIR VISION CLOUDED BY THE LEGENDARY ALE ELEMENTAL'S UNPREDICTABLE ANTICS.\nArmor Class : 13\nHit Points: 40 Hit Dice : 7d8+7\nSpeed: walk : 30",
